## Statement

Grandi's series $1-1+1-1+\cdots$ is Abel summable to $1/2$ but diverges ordinarily.

## Facts & Assumptions

**Given:** Coefficients $a_n=(-1)^n$.

[L1] For $0\le x<1$, $\sum_{n\ge0}(-1)^nx^n=1/(1+x)$ ([[thm-geometric-series]]).

