title: "The alternating series test: if $(b_k)$ is nonincreasing with $b_k \\to 0$ then $\\sum_{k} (-1)^{k} b_k$ converges, the sum lies between any two consecutive partial sums, and the error after $n$ terms is at most $b_n$"
